<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <title>iTop MCP Server Help</title>
        <style>
        body {
          margin: 1em;
          font-size: 12pt;
          font-family: Arial,Helvetica,Sans-Serif;
        }
        pre {
            background-color: #eeeeee;
            padding: 1rem;
        }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <h1>iTop MCP Server</h1>
        <p>Congratulations, you have installed your MCP server to interact with iTop.</p>
        {% if iTopUrl === '' %}
        <p>To complete your configuration, create a file '<tt>.env.local</tt>' in the directory '<tt>{{ projectDir }}</tt>' with the following content:
        <pre>
#{{projectDir}}/.env.local
### iTop URL ###
APP_ITOP_URL=https://url-to-your-itop-instance
###
</pre>
        </p>
        <p><button onclick="javascript:window.location.reload();">Refresh</button></p>
        {% else %}
        <p>The MCP server is configured to interact with iTop located at: <a href="{{iTopUrl}}" target="_blank">{{iTopUrl}}</a> {% if http_code === 200 %}[✅ Ok]{% else %}[❌ KO, HTTP code: {{ http_code }}]{% endif %}</p>
        <ol>To use the MCP server in your favorite AI agent:
        <li>Create either an Application Token or a Personal Token in iTop, with the desired profiles.</li>
        <li>Configure your AI agent with the following information:
        <pre>
"mcpServers": {
    "itop-mcp-server": {
        "type": "streamable-http",
        "url": "{{mcpUri}}",
        "headers": {
           "Authorization": "Bearer =======YOUR-ITOP-TOKEN-HERE====="
        }
    }
}</pre>
        </li>
        </ol>
        {% endif %}
    </body>
</html>
